{"code":"043710","name":"코스리거글로벌","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"건강관리업체및서비스","sector_desc":"병원·유통·의료 서비스. 의료 정책과 보험 수가 변화의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 1991년 설립, 2002년 코스닥 상장 후 더마코스메틱 ODM 제조사 코스리거를 설립하고, 2025년 스킨케어 브랜드 '비플레인' 운영사를 인수해 화장품 밸류체인을 완성함. 화장품, 헬스케어, 그린테크, 뉴미디어마케팅 사업을 영위하고 있음. 코스리거 제조공장은 ISO 22716 인증 기반 화장품을 생산하며, 모먼츠컴퍼니와의 시너지로 글로벌 뷰티 시장 입지를 강화하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-27","n_days":299,"close":2915.0,"open":2700.0,"high":3000.0,"low":2700.0,"volume":3448,"amount":10050920.0,"ret_1d":2.8219,"gap":-4.7619,"range_pct":10.2916,"ret_5":-0.5119,"ret_20":-5.8158,"ret_60":-1.0187,"ret_120":-35.5801,"ret_250":-37.7801,"ma20":3042.75,"ma60":3165.9167,"ma120":3506.0,"ma200":3820.1,"close_vs_ma200":-23.6931,"close_vs_ma60":-7.9256,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-41.7541,"r2_60":0.2111,"slope_120":-57.9112,"r2_120":0.7201,"slope_250":-33.9404,"r2_250":0.6559,"high52":5630.0,"low52":2310.0,"pos_52w":18.2229,"dd_52w":-48.2238,"mdd_1y":-51.0074,"atr14_pct":13.6854,"vol_ann_60":100.8684,"vol_avg20":5370.35,"vol_ratio20":0.642,"vr5":0.4255,"vr20":0.4944,"amount_avg5":11431700.0,"amount_avg20":16371111.75,"amount_avg60":30294538.5833,"obv_chg20":9.6996,"turnover_20":0.6204,"pv_eff_20":-9.3743,"rsi14":47.3595,"frgn_net_5":-58.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0003,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0003,"frgn_net_20":-522.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.003,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.003,"frgn_net_60":1578.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0091,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0091,"frgn_net_120":-18741.0,"inst_net_120":-23778.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.1083,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.1373,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.2456,"foreign_ratio":0.27,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-6.0,"op_margin_q":-1.4151,"op_qoq":-140.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":25.0,"rev_yoy":328.2828,"op_trend_4q":47.7108,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-38.12,"debt_ratio":745.64,"per":null,"pbr":2.11,"div_yield":null,"foreign_r